{
  "slug": "prodscope",
  "name": "Prodscope",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Prodscope adds a structured Builder-Breaker loop to your AI coding assistant so every change is challenged for production risks before it lands.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **5 skills**, **2 commands** and **2 hooks**.\n\n- **Skills** (5): `breaker` (Use when reviewing a Builder proposal for production risks — stress-test for failure modes, REJECT with loop-back when…), `builder` (Use when implementing or proposing code changes that will be reviewed for production readiness), `reliability` (Use after Breaker ACCEPT and Verification to score the final change 1-10 on reliability with an explicit rubric), `using-prodscope` (Use when starting a session or before treating any implementation as complete — establishes whether the Builder-Breaker loop…), `verification` (Use after Breaker ACCEPT and before Reliability scoring — gates completion on evidence that smoke steps actually pass)\n- **Commands** (2): `build` (Run the full Builder → Breaker → Verify → Score loop in a single pass), `verify` (Run after Builder proposes changes — structured verification using MCP when configured (Sentry, Datadog, Cloudflare, Stripe, AWS, etc.))\n- **Hooks** (2): `SessionStart`, `TaskCompleted`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install prodscope@claude-community` from `ashokdudhade/prodscope`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 5,
    "hook": 2,
    "command": 2
  },
